@ 31.1 - Proto-Nyulnyulan to Bardi
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Bowern, Claire Louise (2004), “Bardi Verb Morphology in Historical Perspective” Some vowel deletions, the conditioning of which the author does not elaborate upon
